00:04:46,666 --> 00:04:52,666
The Lawless is a action, thriller film directed by Phillip Guzman.

2
00:09:33,333 --> 00:09:39,333
Two undercover narcotics officers' cover is blown and the
Mexican cartel has kidnapped their families.

3
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:26,000
To get them back they must do the unthinkable for the next 24 hours.

4
00:19:06,666 --> 00:19:12,666
The rules are simple: No guns, no bombs and no witnesses.

5
00:23:53,333 --> 00:23:59,333
They must become The Lawless.

6
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:46,000
Ana, played by Natalie Bell.

7
00:33:26,666 --> 00:33:32,666
Gene, played by Eryn Brooke.

8
00:38:13,333 --> 00:38:19,333
Bogota, played by William Burch.

9
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:06,000
Costello, played by Luis Caldeira.

10
00:47:46,666 --> 00:47:52,666
Frank, played by Jason Riley Hoss.

11
00:52:33,333 --> 00:52:39,333
Victor, played by Denton Blane Everett.

12
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
Lucille Frances Lawless  (née Ryan; born 29 March 1968)
is a New Zealand actress and director.

13
01:02:06,666 --> 01:02:12,666
She is best known for her roles as Xena in the television series Xena: Warrior Princess, as D'Anna Biers on the reimagined
Battlestar Galactica series, and Lucretia in the television series Spartacus: Blood and Sand and associated series.

14
01:06:53,333 --> 01:06:59,333
Since 2019, she has starred as Alexa in the television series My Life Is Murder.

15
01:11:40,000 --> 01:11:46,000
Lawless had recurring roles as Diane Lewis-Swanson on the NBC sitcom Parks and Recreation (2012–2014), and
as Countess Palatine Ingrid von Marburg on the WGN America supernatural series Salem (2015).

16
01:16:26,666 --> 01:16:32,666
She also starred as Ruby on the Starz horror-comedy
series Ash vs Evil Dead (2015–2018).

